@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h3>
    <br />
    Please login using the Login button on the navigation bar on the left of this page 
    <br />
    <br />
    The system will not allow you to run any reports until you have successfully logged in using your<br />
    Microsoft 365 credentials to authenticate for this system.
    <br />
    <br />
    Once logged in this website will allow you to run RGB Reports with dynamic filter options depending on<br />
    specific report that you have selected.
    <br />
    <br />
    The data that is displayed in the reports is based on your access level and permissions for the<br />
    specific report that you have selected.
    <br />
    <br />
    All reports use realtime data pulled directly from the RGB Data Warehouse in realtime<br />
    and therefore the data from SAP and the Website is 100% accurate and up to date.
    <br />
    <br />
    You will only be able to see and run reports for which you have permission for however the system has<br />
    many reports that are available to you based on your access level and permissions so please ask if you<br />
    need a report that is not currently available to you.
    <br />
    <br />
    All report requests are logged for audit and diagnostic purposes.
    <br />
    <br />
    Reports can be produced in either Microsoft Excel or Adobe PDF Format depending on the dimensions of<br />
    the report you have selected. When more than one format is available for a report you will be able to<br />
    select the format you want to use.<br />
</h3>

<style>
    .home-title {
        text-align: center;
    }
</style>